{
  "slug": "claude-bot",
  "name": "Claude Bot",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Persistent Claude Code agent with long-term memory, cron jobs, and a background daemon\n\nYour AI assistant that actually remembers. claude-bot runs a persistent Claude Code session as a background daemon, with an Obsidian-style memory graph that persists across all sessions and restarts. Ask it about your projects, deadlines, and decisions from any Claude Code session — it knows the context.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `setup` (Interactive setup for claude-bot — asks who you are, personalizes the bot, and installs it as a background…) and **1 MCP server**, `claude-bot`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-bot@claude-community` from `michaelslain/claude-bot`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
